  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Hi. I've noticed since the update last night, when I play in Desktop mode, I'm slightly crouched while standing as if I'm playing in VR with my height calibrated incorrectly. When I sit, my neck gets squished into the rest of my body as if I had that same issue. I feel helpless since there's no way I can fix this.\nThe problem is exaggerated with short avatars.\nWhen I look at other players who are in Desktop mode, it looks like they're having the same problem.\nIt was working fine yesterday morning, but last night is when I started having this problem.\nThe version is current: w_2020.3.2p2",
